What is the time complexity of the following code fragment in terms of n?

```c
int count = 0;
for (int i = 1; i < n; i = i * 2)
    for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)
        count++;
```

What does the function below return when called on the list 1 → 2 → 3 → 4?

```c
struct Node { int data; struct Node *next; };

struct Node *f(struct Node *head) {
    struct Node *prev = NULL, *cur = head;
    while (cur != NULL) {
        struct Node *nxt = cur->next;
        cur->next = prev;
        prev = cur;
        cur = nxt;
    }
    return prev;
}
```
